00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:13.240
No one talks about this, but Shane has a massive YouTube presence.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.880
He's one of the longest standing and best loved creators on the platform.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:20.560
He doesn't need to be nervous with anyone,  and yet

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.260
he portrays himself as being insecure in front of his subjects.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:28.900
Well, whether he means it or not, he's priming his audience to feel the same way he does,

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:31.520
like he's entering the presence of someone much greater.

